fp(37,6,main="Jerry explains why he does not want to work on Sundays. He once had a seven-day license, but it was too hard for him and his horses. He wants Sundays for rest, for his family, and for a place of worship.")
fp(38,13,main="Jerry says that Polly is as good as the minister. He will be ready for Dinah at ten, and asks Polly to go and ask the butcher for his light trap.")
sub(40,4,"as many of them must in the busy time","as many of them must in the season")
